{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/809802-using-technology-in-the-umbra","id":809802,"title":"Using technology in the Umbra","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-15T12:55:29-08:00","id":809802,"title":"Using technology in the Umbra","content":"I dont recall anywhere in the corebook telling that you cannot use some technological item in the umbra. <br /> <br /> Am I right?<br /> <br /> Or, let's say, the digital camera will not work but a &quot;Mechanical&quot; one will?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5023-divine_patience","name":"Divine_Patience","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5023_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-15T12:58:07-08:00","id":809805,"title":"","content":"Well I doubt you could get a decent cell or gps signal...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-15T13:57:12-08:00","id":809827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/809802-using-technology-in-the-umbra?p=809805#post809805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I doubt you could get a decent cell or gps signal...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure a Net Spider could fix that for you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Technological items work normally in the Umbra, as long as you manage to get them there properly. Dedicating complicated items takes a merry while, but if you're willing to do it or drag it into umbra via gifts it'll be fine.<br /> <br /> Of course, receiving signals would be a problem as Dwight pointed out, but even that's fixable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-15T15:09:08-08:00","id":809864,"title":"","content":"Given the right Gifts, they'll work just fine. Befriend a Glass Walker and you're set. Probably some of the items you wanna use have a bit more.. character over there, but as long as you've been good to them, that shouldn't pose much of a problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T14:02:07-08:00","id":810803,"title":"","content":"If it's needs a internet or satilite signal then it'll likely not work in the umbra would the assistance of spirits or fetish tech. I always imagined the more techinlogical the item the more likely you'd find a weaver spirit crawling in the tech.<br /> <br /> If you want to take it further have the item change in some way. Imagine taking the clip from your gun and finding it full of metal cryslislis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/982-cptmachine","name":"Cptmachine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar982_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}